{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI have arrived safely in Kassel. The journey from Brunswick was tedious; our carriage waited at Northeim for hours, so I hired a private chaise through Göttingen to Münden, arriving late. I slept until six this morning and pushed on.\n\nMy companion is an Englishman, perhaps twenty-six, returning from Italy to Paris. He speaks little of the country he has just left, but his eyes are tired. He reminds me of the restless youth one sees in Berlin, yet there is a quietness in him now. I find myself watching how he carries himself, noting the difference between the freedom he claims and the discipline he lacks. It is a small lesson in ethics, observed on the road.\n\nThe weather is pleasant. I shall dine here tonight and continue tomorrow. Do not worry; I am in good spirits. Give my love to the boys.\n\nYour affectionate husband,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795218918,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":197,"prompt_tokens":959,"total_tokens":1156,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-BbscX5bBhRIuRXYu5RLyergWm5tjiNAM","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":959,"prompt_ms":887.054,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.924978102189781,"prompt_per_second":1081.106674452739,"predicted_n":197,"predicted_ms":4629.368,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.619224489795922,"predicted_per_second":42.33839262724415}}